  ✓ Stage 2: assess program fidelity, regenerate solution.mpy, and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Stage 3: freshly rebuild definitions and reconstruct every positive proof
  ✓ Stages 4–5: audit claim adequacy, program pinning, and every K rule statically
  ✓ Stage 6: create and run a fresh meaningful non-vacuity mutation
  ✓ Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed facts and issue REVIEW.md verdict
