Verdict: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**

Both positive claims freshly reconstructed with `#Top`, but the main proof relies on an unsound loop bridge that omits the theorem’s `<env> 1` constraint. A ground `"a"` witness proves a false frame update under the extended theory while the bridge-free semantics rejects it.

Detailed report: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
